en:
read on mail.ru:
the most ridiculous official reasons for quitting (these reasons were officially stated in resignation letters):
- my boss stinks;

- a dog keeps barking outside the window. It's making me dumber;

- the office carpets are dirty-green. They depress me;

- the cleaning lady harassed me. I can't bear such shame;

- I don't have a stapler.

The first reason seems perfectly normal to me...
